<title>USA: Hussey copper price raised 2 cents to 110 cents.</title>
<headline>Hussey copper price raised 2 cents to 110 cents.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hussey Copper Ltd said its contained copper price was raised two cents to 110 cents a lb effective with November 1 shipments.</p>
<p>--New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
